、この訴訟に新たな進展がないか、毎学期、学校の留学生オフィス（International Student Office）の通知を確認してください"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["国土安全部 2026 年 7 月 17 日公布了一项规则，原定 2026 年 9 月 15 日生效。内容是 F-1 学生不再按「读完为止」入境，改成固定期限，最长四年，到期要另外申请延期。读完或者实习结束后，只留 30 天准备离境。2026 年 9 月 14 日，马萨诸塞州联邦地区法院的 Saylor 法官依《行政程序法》第 705 条，推迟了这项规则的生效。暂停管全国，管整份规则。法院没有撤销这项规则，撤销的请求被驳回，但允许以后再提。案子还在继续审。裁判所のこの命令に従い、F、J、Iビザの保持者は引き続き「プログラム終了まで」の入国が認められ、60 日間の出国猶予期間も従来通り適用され、別途延長申請を行う必要もありません"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["DHS (2026). Establishing a Fixed Time Period of Admission and an Extension of Stay Procedure for Nonimmigrant Academic Students, Exchange Visitors（2026-07-17 公布，原定 2026-09-15 生效）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/17/2026-14439/establishing-a-fixed-time-period-of-admission-and-an-extension-of-stay-procedure-for-nonimmigrant","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/17/2026-14439/establishing-a-fixed-time-period-of-admission-and-an-extension-of-stay-procedure-for-nonimmigrant"]},"；Presidents' Alliance on Higher Education and Immigration v. U.S. Department of Homeland Security, No. 1:26-cv-13799-FDS (D. Mass. Sept. 14, 2026)，法院案卷. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/74661796/presidents-alliance-on-higher-education-and-immigration-v-united-states/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/74661796/presidents-alliance-on-higher-education-and-immigration-v-united-states/"]},"；Yale Office of International Students & Scholars (2026-09-14). Important Update: Court Action on the D/S Rule. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://oiss.yale.edu/news/important-update-court-action-on-the-ds-rule","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://oiss.yale.edu/news/important-update-court-action-on-the-ds-rule"]},"；AILA (2026). One Day Before Taking Effect, Federal Court Postpones the F, J, and I Fixed Admission Period Rule. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.aila.org/blog/think-immigration-one-day-before-taking-effect-federal-court-postpones-the-f-j-and-i-fixed-admission-period-rule","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.aila.org/blog/think-immigration-one-day-before-taking-effect-federal-court-postpones-the-f-j-and-i-fixed-admission-period-rule"]},"；8 CFR 214.2(f). ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-8/chapter-I/subchapter-B/part-214/section-214.2","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-8/chapter-I/subchapter-B/part-214/section-214.2"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/17/2026-14439/establishing-a-fixed-time-period-of-admission-and-an-extension-of-stay-procedure-for-nonimmigrant","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["本情報は 2026 年 9 月 25 日時点のものです。政府は第1巡回控訴裁判所に控訴することができ、国土安全保障省は規則を修正して再発行することも可能です。したがって、数年間の留学を予定している方は、旧規則がずっと変わらないと決めつけないでください。裁判所は 2026 年 10 月 2 日に双方の進捗報告を聴取するための期日を定めています。その日を過ぎたら、再度学校の通知を確認してください。新規則が将来施行される場合、期限の延長には期限が切れる前に別途申請が必要であり、自動更新はされません。旧規則の下で、途中で留学を中止する場合、出国期限は修了した場合とは異なります。学校の留学生オフィスに事前に確認してください。Jビザも同じ規則内にありますが、詳細はF-1 と異なりますので、自身のビザカテゴリーに従って確認してください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/32-01"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"学費を支払う前に、学校がCSCSE（中国教育部留学サービスセンター）の認定校リストに含まれているか確認すること"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/32-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"アルバイトの時間は米・加・英・豪の4カ国すべてにおいて厳格なレッドラインであり、1時間でも超過すればビザ条件違反となる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/32-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["身分の根拠は「フルタイム在学」：休学、退学、転校の空白期間は一切アルバイト禁止"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["アルバイトができるかどうかは、フルタイムで在学中であるかによります。一度休学、退学、退学処分、または転校期間中に授業を受けていない状態にな…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/32-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["アメリカ：引越し後 10 日以内に新住所を届け出る必要があります"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["アメリカで居住地を変更した場合、法律により 10 日以内に移民局へ通知することが義務付けられています。届け出を怠ることは軽微な問題ではあり…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/32-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出発前および在学期間中、教育部の留学警告をチェックしましょう"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["教育部は、特定の国や地域において、近年の治安や政策が中国人留学生にとって不利である場合、専用の警告を発令します。これは公式に公開されている…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/32-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["オーストラリア：OSHCは全滞在期間をカバーし、中断がないことが必須。入国時に保険を提示できないと入国拒否の可能性あり"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["オーストラリアでは留学生医療保険（OSHC）がビザの条件となっており、任意ではなく加入が義務付けられています。保険は滞在期間全体をカバーし…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/32-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["イギリス：ビザ申請料のほかに、年単位で支払う医療附加金があり、学生は毎年 776 ポンド、申請時に一括払い"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["イギリスへ行く際にかかる費用はビザ申請料だけではありません。ビザの期間に応じて医療附加金を前払いする必要があり、これを支払うことでイギリス…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/32-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["帰国前に認証の時間を確保：留服認証には 10 から 20 営業日が必要です"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["海外の学位を帰国後に使用する場合、事前に学位認証を受ける必要があります。審査だけで 10 から 20 営業日かかります。採用シーズンや書類…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/32"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：海外留学：ビザのステータス、アルバイト、保険、そして学位の認証"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.